## Architecture

{{ARCHITECTURE_LAYERS}}

Controllers stay thin: accept a validated request, delegate, return a response.
Form Requests (`app/Http/Requests`) own input validation. Models
(`app/Models`) own persistence, relationships, and casts — not business rules.

