## The quality gate

{{QUALITY_GATE}}

The same script backs the git pre-commit hook, Claude's Stop hook, and CI, so the
result is identical in all three. Do not work around it: no `--no-verify`, no
`@phpstan-ignore`, no skipped tests, no baseline. Fix the cause.
{{FEATURE_DOCS}}
